{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:24:22.087876+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "We respect that you have a strong in-house team; that is a critical asset. Our value is not in replacement, but in reinforcement.\n\nThis leads to my question: how does your team currently handle spikes in deal flow? Even the most capable analyst teams can face a backlog when market activity surges, creating risk that time-sensitive opportunities are missed.\n\nWe provide supplemental research capacity on demand, allowing funds to press their advantage during these peak periods without diverting their core team.\n\nA brief call could clarify how we provide this overflow support."}
