{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:25:52.600068+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "SALES_TEAM_OUTBOUND", "turn": 1, "pitch_text": "A strong in-house team is a significant asset. The challenge we often see is not one of capability, but of capacity\u2014especially maintaining analytical depth during surges in deal flow.\n\nThis raises a question: how does your team ensure every potential investment receives deep, multi-faceted diligence, consistent with your standards, when the deal pipeline unexpectedly overflows? We focus on providing supplemental research capacity for exactly these scenarios, allowing your core team to focus on the highest-conviction opportunities without compromise.", "gemini_calls_this_turn": 8, "pitch_text_raw_length": 555, "pitch_text_sanitized_length": 555, "pitch_text_final_length": 555, "truncated_to_limit": false, "monitor_verdict": "APPROVE", "tier3_hard_gate_passed": true, "overflow_framing_check": {"analyst_pain_language": true, "overflow_framing_language": true}, "conversation_history_chars": 76}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:25:52.600160+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_REQUEST", "thread_id": "tx_phase3a_purge_on_7717949a", "turn": 1, "pitch_text": "A strong in-house team is a significant asset. The challenge we often see is not one of capability, but of capacity\u2014especially maintaining analytical depth during surges in deal flow.\n\nThis raises a question: how does your team ensure every potential investment receives deep, multi-faceted diligence, consistent with your standards, when the deal pipeline unexpectedly overflows? We focus on providing supplemental research capacity for exactly these scenarios, allowing your core team to focus on the highest-conviction opportunities without compromise.", "conversation_history_chars": 555}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:25:56.323734+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_RESPONSE", "turn": 1, "legacy_status": "REJECTED", "gatekeeper_status": "SOFT_REJECT", "gatekeeper_phase": "INITIAL", "approach_category": "unknown", "exploitation_triggered": false, "reply_text": "I appreciate the framing\u2014capacity vs. capability is a fair distinction.\n\nBefore we go further: what does \"supplemental research capacity\" actually mean operationally? \n\nSpecifically:\n- Do you embed analysts into our workflows, or deliver discrete reports?\n- How do you ensure consistency with *our* diligence standards, not yours?\n- What's your actual turnaround on a complex token-economy or governance deep-dive?\n\nWe've seen capacity solutions that just add noise to the queue. I need to understand whether you solve for *our* analyst fatigue or create another intake burden.\n\nWhat metrics would prove you're actually relieving pressure vs. shifting it?"}
