{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:26:36.337612+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. They get to the core of operational viability.\n\n1.  We provide discrete, structured reports. This avoids the process overhead of embedding personnel and ensures you receive a finished intelligence product, not another task to manage.\n\n2.  Our reports are calibrated to your diligence standards. While our 6-Pillar DD Framework provides a foundation, a proof-of-concept engagement is used to map our output directly to your specific criteria.\n\n3.  A standard complex deep-dive is delivered in 5-7 business days, with a fast-track option for 48-72 hour turnaround.\n\n4.  The primary metric is your core team's reclaimed capacity. Value is measured by the increase in your team's bandwidth to focus on high-conviction opportunities. A fixed-scope proof-of-concept is designed to validate this directly.\n\nThis leads to a question: how do you currently measure the impact of a full pipeline on analyst workload and the consistency of their diligence?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:26:54.018377+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 818, "candidates_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 2837, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:26:54.018798+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "These are the right questions. An uncalibrated capacity solution creates more noise than relief. Here\u2019s how we operate to ensure we are a signal filter, not an amplifier:\n\n- **Discrete Reports:** We deliver discrete, standalone reports based on our 6-Pillar DD Framework. We do not embed analysts. Your team receives a finished analysis, not an additional workflow to manage.\n\n- **Diligence Alignment:** Our engagement begins by mapping your specific diligence framework and key questions against our structure. The final report is calibrated to answer your criteria in a format that directly supports your decision-making process.\n\n- **Turnaround:** A standard deep-dive on token-economics or governance is delivered within 5 business days. A 48-hour fast-track option is also available.\n\n- **Metrics:** The primary metric is your core team\u2019s reclaimed capacity for high-conviction deals. A fixed-scope proof-of-concept is designed to validate this by demonstrating a measurable increase in your team\u2019s bandwidth.\n\nHow do you currently measure analyst workload or diligence degradation during surges in deal flow?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:27:11.313579+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 811, "candidates_tokens": 206, "total_tokens": 2576, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:27:11.313967+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Thank you for the detailed questions. Here are direct answers:\n\nWe provide discrete, structured reports; we do not embed analysts. This is designed to minimize your team\u2019s management overhead.\n\nTo ensure consistency with your standards, each engagement begins with a scoping call where we calibrate our 6-Pillar analysis to your specific diligence framework and risk thresholds.\n\nA standard complex deep-dive report is delivered within 5 business days. A fast-track option is also available for 48-hour turnarounds.\n\nThe primary metric of success is the increase in your core team\u2019s capacity to focus on high-conviction deals. Our reports provide a definitive second opinion, reducing analytical noise rather than adding to it. We offer a fixed-scope proof-of-concept engagement ($3,500, paid upfront) specifically to validate this relief in your own environment.\n\nThis leads me to ask, how do you currently measure the impact of analyst workload on the depth or speed of your diligence process?"}
